{:edb/db-before-t 2217 :edb/db-after-t 2218 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535530 50 #inst "2026-10-09T01:53:54.787Z" 13194139535530 true] [17592186078476 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353853 13194139535530 true] [17592186078844 1100 "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\frac{\\sqrt{x} - 2}{x - 4}$." 13194139535530 false] [17592186078844 1100 "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-2}{x-4}.$" 13194139535530 true] [17592186078844 1145 "If we attempt to evaluate the limit, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-2}{x-4} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{4}-2}{4-4}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the numerator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the numerator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-2}{x-4} & ={lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}-2)(\\sqrt{x}+2)}{(x-4)(\\sqrt{x}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{{(\\sqrt{x})}^{2}-{2}^{2}}{(x-4)(\\sqrt{x}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{x-4}{(x-4)(\\sqrt{x}+2)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 4}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4}+2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353854 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1089 "q-302322" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1100 "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x+1}-1}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1113 #uuid "c2769d9a-ddb4-50d7-a6fa-fc81c76cd49c" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353853 1145 "If we attempt to evaluate the limit by simply evaluating the function at $x=0$, we get an indeterminate form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x+1}-1} & =\\frac{0}{\\sqrt{0+1}-1}=\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we need to first simplify the limit. Since the radical is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x+1}-1} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{(\\sqrt{x+1}-1)(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{(\\sqrt{x+1})^{2}-{1}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{(x+1)-1} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{x(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{x} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\cancel{x}(\\sqrt{x+1}+1)}{\\cancel{x}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}(\\sqrt{x+1}+1) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{0+1}+1 \\\\  & =1+1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353855 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353856 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1041 "field-1" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353855 13194139535530 true] [17592186353854 1110 #uuid "686cebf8-b881-5bb8-aaf1-d98b1c24baa1" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353855 1034 "2" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353855 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535530 true] [17592186353855 1111 #uuid "24cf0ad0-ab60-5a30-9ac4-3231c0c94e85" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353856 1034 "1" 13194139535530 true] [17592186353856 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535530 true] [17592186353856 1111 #uuid "b6726a7e-b16a-5b7e-9ea4-282df7d3b681" 13194139535530 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-302322" 17592186353853 "q-302322/field-1" 17592186353854 "q-302322/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" 17592186353855 "q-302322/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" 17592186353856} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
